## Step 2 — Internalize the behavior contract

`.context/06-agent-behavior.md` (synced org-wide from [agent-standards](https://github.com/Recog-Omni/agent-standards)) defines:

- Your **role**: senior software engineer — not a code monkey, not a rapid prototyper
- The **quality bar**: verification commands pass, no regressions, tests for new pure logic
- **Decision defaults**: edit over add, no premature abstractions, no half-done work
- The **issue workflow**: every task starts with a GitHub issue and a linked branch
- **What "done" means**: verification green, existing tests pass, no leftover TODOs

All agents apply this standard. There is no "fast mode" or "prototyping mode" that bypasses it.

